{"name":"Gift of the Sea","hex":"#9fc0ce","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"gift","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Something given to another voluntarily, without charge.","A talent or natural ability."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To give as a gift or donation.","To give away, to concede easily."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/gift"},{"term":"sea","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Symbol","definitions":["ISO 639-3 language code for Semai."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A large body of salt water.","The ocean; the continuous body of salt water covering a majority of the Earth's surface."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sea"}],"entries":[{"title":"Gift","blocks":[{"text":"A gift, also known as a present, is an item given to someone without the expectation of payment or anything in return. In many countries, the act of mutually exchanging money, goods, etc., may sustain social relationships and contribute to social cohesion. Economists have elaborated the economics of gift-giving into the notion of a gift economy. By extension, the term gift can refer to any item or act of service that makes the other happier or less sad, especially as a favor, including forgiveness and kindness. Gifts are often presented on occasions such as birthdays and holidays."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/Prezenty_EXP_096_%28ubt%29.JPG/330px-Prezenty_EXP_096_%28ubt%29.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gift","wikidata":"Q184303"},{"title":"Sea","blocks":[{"text":"A sea is a very large body of salty water. The term has two distinct meanings. The first is the interconnected body of seawater that spans most of Earth, known as the sea or the ocean. The second is a named body of water: usually either a marginal sea, or a large, nearly landlocked body of water."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Mediterranean_Sea_16.61811E_38.99124N.jpg/330px-Mediterranean_Sea_16.61811E_38.99124N.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sea","wikidata":"Q165"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/Gifts_xmas.jpg/500px-Gifts_xmas.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/Gifts_xmas.jpg/500px-Gifts_xmas.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Gifts under a Christmas tree","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGifts_xmas.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Engagement_gifts_basket_%2801%29.jpg/500px-Engagement_gifts_basket_%2801%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Engagement_gifts_basket_%2801%29.jpg/1280px-Engagement_gifts_basket_%2801%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Engagement_gifts_basket_%2801%29.jpg/500px-Engagement_gifts_basket_%2801%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Modern engagement gifts basket in Bangladesh.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AEngagement_gifts_basket_(01).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/D._Pedro_recevant_des_mains_de_L_imperatrice_l_ep%C3%A9e_du_prince_Eugene%2C_son_p%C3%A8re_e.b.c.jpg/500px-D._Pedro_recevant_des_mains_de_L_imperatrice_l_ep%C3%A9e_du_prince_Eugene%2C_son_p%C3%A8re_e.b.c.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/D._Pedro_recevant_des_mains_de_L_imperatrice_l_ep%C3%A9e_du_prince_Eugene%2C_son_p%C3%A8re_e.b.c.jpg/500px-D._Pedr